{"4010410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Drifting Crown", "steam_appid": 4010410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4798920], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Drifting Crown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Drifting Crown</strong> is a Victorian-era steampunk <strong>action-adventure rogue-lite</strong> where every run reshapes the world  and every death brings you one step closer to reopening the last pub on Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why the pub?<br>Because when the ale runs dry, civilisation collapses. And frankly, no one survives the apocalypse sober.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build the World. Brave the Ruins. Die. Improve. Repeat.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each run, you <strong>rebuild the shattered world using mystical tiles</strong> you’ve earned through survival (and failure).<br>Forests, sludge-choked fields, and industrial wastelands. Each run being unique to you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your route</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The horrors waiting for you in the dark</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive in. Fight brutal enemies. Scavenge upgrades. Push your luck. <br>You <i>will</i> die, but every run makes the next one deadlier… for them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Death Is Inevitable. Progress Is Permanent.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure isn’t the end, it’s the plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run unlocks:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stronger weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgraded gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New tiles, paths, and secrets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until one day, you’re powerful enough to survive long enough to earn that drink.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Combat with Teeth</strong><br>Every run is different. Enemies evolve. Mistakes are punished. Learning is mandatory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tile-Based Worldbuilding</strong><br>Reconstruct each area before you explore it. Shape the world, unlock shortcuts, and decide which dangers you’re willing to face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade or Perish</strong><br>Spend hard-earned currencies to improve weapons, gear, and abilities, because dying slightly slower <i>is</i> progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Pub Hub</strong><br>Your central base for upgrades, characters, and story. A place of refuge in a world that desperately needs one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steampunk Style &amp; British Humour</strong><br>A Victorian-inspired apocalypse of pipes, gears, sarcasm, and stubborn optimism.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save the Pub. Save the World.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ruins are crawling with monsters. Machines meant to protect humanity have lost their minds.<br>The world is falling apart, but as long as there’s hope, humour, and one last drink to be poured, it’s not over yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your weapon. Face another fatal run.<br>And remember:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the pub. Save the world.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Drifting Crown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Drifting Crown</strong> is a Victorian-era steampunk <strong>action-adventure rogue-lite</strong> where every run reshapes the world  and every death brings you one step closer to reopening the last pub on Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why the pub?<br>Because when the ale runs dry, civilisation collapses. And frankly, no one survives the apocalypse sober.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build the World. Brave the Ruins. Die. Improve. Repeat.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each run, you <strong>rebuild the shattered world using mystical tiles</strong> you’ve earned through survival (and failure).<br>Forests, sludge-choked fields, and industrial wastelands. Each run being unique to you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your route</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The horrors waiting for you in the dark</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive in. Fight brutal enemies. Scavenge upgrades. Push your luck. <br>You <i>will</i> die, but every run makes the next one deadlier… for them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Death Is Inevitable. Progress Is Permanent.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure isn’t the end, it’s the plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run unlocks:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stronger weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgraded gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New tiles, paths, and secrets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until one day, you’re powerful enough to survive long enough to earn that drink.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Combat with Teeth</strong><br>Every run is different. Enemies evolve. Mistakes are punished. Learning is mandatory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tile-Based Worldbuilding</strong><br>Reconstruct each area before you explore it. Shape the world, unlock shortcuts, and decide which dangers you’re willing to face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade or Perish</strong><br>Spend hard-earned currencies to improve weapons, gear, and abilities, because dying slightly slower <i>is</i> progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Pub Hub</strong><br>Your central base for upgrades, characters, and story. A place of refuge in a world that desperately needs one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steampunk Style &amp; British Humour</strong><br>A Victorian-inspired apocalypse of pipes, gears, sarcasm, and stubborn optimism.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save the Pub. Save the World.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ruins are crawling with monsters. Machines meant to protect humanity have lost their minds.<br>The world is falling apart, but as long as there’s hope, humour, and one last drink to be poured, it’s not over yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your weapon. Face another fatal run.<br>And remember:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the pub. Save the world.</strong></p>", "short_description": "A Victorian-era steampunk, action adventure game with roguelike elements where death is inevitable, monsters get nastier every run, and your noble quest to reopen the only pub left standing. Build your way to success, upgrade your skill tree to become more powerful, dispatch your enemies in style!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010410/0b4d2ad6a914f243d4a5ec19a1223ea3628607e7/header.jpg?t=1783506392", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010410/adfba13a2978d1fad5df311336134c2256c7f353/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783506392", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010410/adfba13a2978d1fad5df311336134c2256c7f353/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783506392", "website": "https://thedriftingcrown.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 1335 (8th gen)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> nVidia RTX 2050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["